  "description": "نُقدِّم حزمةً متكاملة من المنتجات الرَّقميَّة، بالإضافة إلى خدماتنا الاحترافيَّة في بناء وصيانة المشاريع البرمجيَّة، والتَّدريب، والاستشارات التِّقنيَّة.",
  "author": "م. أيْهَم العَلي",
  "license": "UNLICENSED",
  "private": true,
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.22.2"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "postinstall": "node -e \"const fs=require('fs'),p=require('path');const d=p.join('node_modules','typescript','lib');if(!fs.existsSync(d)){fs.mkdirSync(d,{recursive:true})}const f=p.join(d,'typescript.js');if(!fs.existsSync(f)){fs.writeFileSync(f,\\\"module.exports = require('typescript/unstable/sync');\\\\n\\\")}\"",
    "dev": "node scripts/dev.mjs",
    "predev": "node scripts/sync-zxing-wasm.mjs && node scripts/generate-sw-config.mjs && node scripts/build-sw-outbox.mjs && node scripts/build-sync-flush.mjs && node scripts/generate-sw-precache.mjs && node scripts/compute-version.mjs",
    "prebuild": "node scripts/sync-zxing-wasm.mjs && node scripts/generate-sw-config.mjs && node scripts/build-sw-outbox.mjs && node scripts/build-sync-flush.mjs && node scripts/generate-icons.mjs && node scripts/compute-version.mjs",
    "build": "tsc --noEmit && next build",
    "postbuild": "node scripts/generate-sw-precache.mjs",
    "start": "next start",
    "lint": "eslint .",
    "lint:fix": "eslint . --fix",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "format": "prettier --write .",
    "format:check": "prettier --check .",
    "test": "vitest run",
    "test:coverage": "vitest run --coverage",
    "test:watch": "vitest",
    "test:e2e": "npx playwright test",
    "visual:baseline": "cross-env VISUAL_BASELINE=update npx playwright test e2e/visual-baseline.spec.ts --project=existing-tests",
    "load-test": "node scripts/load-test.mjs",
    "icons": "node scripts/generate-icons.mjs",
    "fonts:subset": "node scripts/subset-fonts.mjs",
    "check:env-docs": "node scripts/check-env-docs.mjs",
    "check:branch-base": "node scripts/check-branch-base.mjs",
    "sync:base": "node scripts/sync-branch-base.mjs",
    "check:arabic": "node scripts/check-arabic-order.mjs",
    "fix:arabic": "node scripts/check-arabic-order.mjs --fix",
    "check:digits": "node scripts/check-digits.mjs",
    "fix:digits": "node scripts/check-digits.mjs --fix",
    "check:surfaces": "node scripts/check-surfaces.mjs",
    "check:screens": "node scripts/check-screens.mjs",
    "check:contracts": "node scripts/generate-contracts.mjs --check",
    "contracts:generate": "node scripts/generate-contracts.mjs",
    "check:tokens": "node scripts/generate-tokens.mjs --check",
    "tokens:generate": "node scripts/generate-tokens.mjs",
    "copy:generate": "node scripts/generate-copy.mjs",
    "check:copy": "node scripts/generate-copy.mjs --check",
    "currency:generate": "node scripts/generate-currency.mjs",
    "check:currency": "node scripts/generate-currency.mjs --check",
    "check:parity": "node scripts/check-parity.mjs",
    "components:generate": "node scripts/generate-components.mjs",
    "check:components": "node scripts/generate-components.mjs --check",
    "vectors:generate": "node scripts/generate-vectors.mjs",
    "check:vectors": "node scripts/generate-vectors.mjs --check",
    "check:precache": "node scripts/check-precache.mjs",
    "quran-search:build": "node scripts/build-quran-search-index.mjs",
    "check:quran-search": "node scripts/build-quran-search-index.mjs --check",
    "check:migrations": "node scripts/check-migration-drift.mjs",
    "check:migrations:safety": "node scripts/check-migration-safety.mjs",
    "check:migrations:grants": "node scripts/check-migration-grants.mjs",
    "perf:baseline": "node scripts/perf-baseline.mjs",
    "perf:baseline:update": "node scripts/perf-baseline.mjs --update-baseline",
    "perf:check": "node scripts/perf-baseline.mjs --check",
    "perf:field": "node scripts/perf-field.mjs",
    "perf:paint": "node scripts/perf-paint.mjs",
    "perf:paint:update": "node scripts/perf-paint.mjs --update",
    "prune:deployments": "node scripts/prune-deployments.mjs",
    "android:sync": "cap sync android",
    "android:apk": "npm run android:sync && node scripts/android.mjs apk",
    "android:release": "cross-env NODE_ENV=production npm run android:sync && node scripts/android.mjs release",
    "android:aab": "cross-env NODE_ENV=production npm run android:sync && node scripts/android.mjs aab",
    "android:verify-bridge": "node scripts/verify-bridge.mjs",
    "spike:build": "vite build",
    "spike:apk": "npm run spike:build && node scripts/android-spike.mjs",
    "spike:verify": "node scripts/verify-two-origin.mjs",
    "android:launch": "node scripts/android-launch.mjs",
    "android:shell-version": "node scripts/android-shell-version.mjs",
    "android:release-plan": "node scripts/android-release.mjs --plan",
    "android:release-notes": "node scripts/android-release.mjs",
    "android:publish": "cross-env NODE_ENV=production node scripts/android-publish.mjs",
    "android:assets": "node scripts/generate-android-assets.mjs",
    "android:test": "npm run android:sync && node scripts/android.mjs test",
    "android:profile": "node scripts/android.mjs profile",
    "prepare": "husky",
    "android:note": "node scripts/android-note.mjs",
    "android:outbox-drill": "node scripts/android-outbox-drill.mjs"
  },
